      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2012 Elsevier Inc. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "Isolated occlusion of the septal perforating branch of the left anterior descending coronary artery is extremely rare. As a result, little is known about its electrocardiographic manifestations compared with those of an anteroseptal myocardial infarction. We present the case of an isolated septal myocardial infarction with ST-segment elevation."
      },
